config BR2_PACKAGE_BUSYBOX_UDHCPC
	bool "BusyBox build for udhcpc only"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_BUSYBOX
	help
	  A dedicated minimal BusyBox carrying only the udhcpc applet.
	  udhcpc stays resident for the lease lifetime, and on NOMMU each
	  process holds a private copy of its binary's text, so a dedicated
	  ~100 KB image replaces the ~500 KB full BusyBox the client used to
	  occupy (#45).  Not merged into busybox-daemons so init, syslogd
	  and inetd do not grow.
